{"file": "我只是大学生，办案才是副业-第106集.mp4", "ep": 106, "duration": 47.1, "segments": [{"start": 0.69, "end": 6.59, "text": "三十年了"}, {"start": 6.59, "end": 8.91, "text": "我这半截身子入土的人"}, {"start": 8.91, "end": 10.91, "text": "也带不走"}, {"start": 10.91, "end": 13.07, "text": "既然有人来找"}, {"start": 13.07, "end": 15.07, "text": "那就让他物归原主吧"}, {"start": 15.07, "end": 17.52, "text": "极品因物"}, {"start": 17.52, "end": 18.65, "text": "妥了"}, {"start": 18.65, "end": 19.65, "text": "刘奶奶"}, {"start": 19.65, "end": 20.65, "text": "太感谢您了"}, {"start": 20.65, "end": 22.65, "text": "您这可是帮了国家的大忙了"}, {"start": 22.65, "end": 23.68, "text": "走"}, {"start": 23.68, "end": 26.79, "text": "苏婉大姐"}, {"start": 26.79, "end": 27.79, "text": "大半夜的"}, {"start": 27.79, "end": 28.79, "text": "还在等快递呢"}, {"start": 28.79, "end": 30.78, "text": "邪"}, {"start": 30.78, "end": 32.91, "text": "我的邪"}, {"start": 33.17, "end": 35.9, "text": "知道"}, {"start": 35.9, "end": 36.9, "text": "没忘"}, {"start": 36.9, "end": 37.9, "text": "您的家计店"}, {"start": 37.9, "end": 38.9, "text": "我给您送到了"}, {"start": 38.9, "end": 39.9, "text": "物归原主"}, {"start": 39.9, "end": 46.82, "text": "一双红鞋半此身"}]}